  "description": "Star chef Lee Kang-Hyeon, who has lost his sense of taste, retreats to a peaceful countryside to escape the public eye. In his grandfather's rural home, he stumbles upon a portal to another world. Taking advantage of his escape, he decides to enjoy a relaxed camping life in this new world. However, the inhabitants of this world keep showing interest in him. Will Kang-Hyeon be able to live a peaceful life? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited)",
